0..74 Comment "// A flow between types holding lists, after directed univalence (Gratzer,"
75..152 Comment "// Weinberger and Buchholtz, _Directed univalence in simplicial homotopy type"
153..230 Comment "// theory_, arXiv:2407.09146, Definition 1.2): a translator that moves a list"
231..308 Comment "// unread is decided at the empty list and at one cell over a rigid tail, and"
309..360 Comment "// riding the flow moves a record holding any list."
